<title>USA: China may have bought U.S. soymeal - trade.</title>
<headline>China may have bought U.S. soymeal - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>There was widespread talk in the U.S. export market that China on Wednesday or late Tuesday bought 25,000 to 50,000 tonnes of U.S. soymeal for February shipment.</p>
<p>However, details of the deal could not be confirmed.</p>
<p>&quot;I have heard the rumors too, but I cannot confirm it,&quot; a U.S. soybean exporter said.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
</text>
